ot to the complex, I walked around the pyramid. I tried to imagine what it looked like long ago.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le11ob03re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "I joined the tour and followed the guide into the Great Pyramid. We only went about 89 feet, but it seemed much farther. The passage was low and narrow. We had to bend down low as we walked . People coming out squeezed by us!", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn5le11ob03re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "Next we moved up to the King's Chamber. It was empty, hot and airless! The pressure inside felt immense - all those stone blocks pushing in! We stayed about 10 minutes then slowly made our way back out. It was an unforgettable experience.", "id": 3, "time": "34250", "image": "engenn5le11ob03re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob03re5aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le11ob03re5img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}